-sm text-zinc-500 mb-1\">Price</p><p class=\"font-semibold text-zinc-900\">$10-30/month (subscription)</p></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-emerald-600 font-medium mb-2\">Pros</p><ul class=\"space-y-1\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-emerald-500\">✓</span><span class=\"text-sm text-zinc-700\">Wider file format support</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-emerald-500\">✓</span><span class=\"text-sm text-zinc-700\">More advanced editing features</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-emerald-500\">✓</span><span class=\"text-sm text-zinc-700\">Cloud storage integration</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-emerald-500\">✓</span><span class=\"text-sm text-zinc-700\">Real-time collaboration</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-emerald-500\">✓</span><span class=\"text-sm text-zinc-700\">Professional publishing tools</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-emerald-500\">✓</span><span class=\"text-sm text-zinc-700\">Cross-platform sync</span></li></ul></div><div><p class=\"text-sm text-red-600 font-medium mb-2\">Cons</p><ul class=\"space-y-1\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-red-500\">✗</span><span class=\"text-sm text-zinc-700\">Subscription model adds up over time</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-red-500\">✗</span><span class=\"text-sm text-zinc-700\">May not preserve table structures</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-red-500\">✗</span><span class=\"text-sm text-zinc-700\">No de-identification feature</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-red-500\">✗</span><span class=\"text-sm text-zinc-700\">Not optimized for AI/RAG use</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-red-500\">✗</span><span class=\"text-sm text-zinc-700\">Complex interface</span></li><